`еЌ-Ѕ!`еЌ-Ѕ!,`еЌ-Ѕ!E`еЌ-Ѕ!\`еЌ-Ѕ!t`еЌ-Ѕ!М`еЌ-Ѕ!£`еЌ-Ѕ!ї`еЌ-Ѕ…␀Number too long␀Expected number␀Double out of range␀Integer out of range␀Expected )␀Integer overflow␀Division by zero␀Double exponent must be an integer␀~ is for integers only␀// is for integers only␀% is for integers only␀Unexpected input␀Available commands:
␀  /help   Show this help text
␀  /bye    Exit the calculator
␀
␀Integers are signed 1024-bit values.
␀Operators:
␀  +   add
␀  -   subtract or unary negation
␀  +   unary plus
␀  *   multiply
␀  /   divide
␀  //  integer division (integers only)
␀  %%   modulus (integers only)
␀  ^   power (exponent)
␀  ~   unary bitwise not (integers only)
␀  =   equality comparison
␀  parentheses: ( and )
␀Examples:
␀  2 + 2          -> 4
␀  10.0 / 4       -> 2.5
␀  10 // 4        -> 2
␀  (3 + 5) * 2    -> 16
␀  7 %% 3          -> 1
␀  2 ^ 3          -> 8
␀  ~5             -> -6
␀  -5 + 3         -> -2
␀ ␀/help␀Error: %s
