␀CHAT.SYS␀CHATC11 - OpenAI / compatible chat client

␀Usage: CHATC11 [-H]

␀Setup may be done from the startup config menu
␀or from CP/M using ESP32 ENV variables.

␀Compatible example:
␀  ENV CHAT_PROVIDER=compatible
␀  ENV CHAT_ENDPOINT=http://host:11434/v1/chat/completions
␀  ENV CHAT_MODEL=gemma3:1b
␀  ENV CHAT_MAX_TOKENS=1024
␀  ENV CHAT_TEMPERATURE=0.7
␀  ENV CHAT_THINK=false

␀Ollama thinking: false (default), true, or default
␀to use the server default. OpenAI ignores CHAT_THINK.

␀OpenAI example:
␀  ENV CHAT_PROVIDER=openai
␀  ENV CHAT_OPENAI_KEY=your-api-key
␀  ENV CHAT_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

␀Missing ENV values are seeded on first run.
␀CHAT_MODEL␀CHAT_MAX_TOKENS␀CHAT_TEMPERATURE␀false␀CHAT_THINK␀none␀true␀medium␀default␀Error: CHAT_THINK must be false, true or default
